  {
   "p": "Look at the last letter: <span class='ar raf'>الْمَكْتَبُ</span> on its own, but <span class='ar jarr'>الْمَكْتَبِ</span> after <span class='ar'>عَلَى</span>. The ḍamma turned into a <strong>kasra</strong>."
